+Passing ``fail_silently``, ``auth_user``, or ``auth_password`` with a ``connection`` to email functions raises ``TypeError``
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+Previously, :func:`~django.core.mail.send_mail`,
+:func:`~django.core.mail.send_mass_mail`, and
+:meth:`EmailMessage.send() <django.core.mail.EmailMessage.send>` silently
+ignored ``fail_silently``, ``auth_user``, and ``auth_password`` when a
+``connection`` was also provided. Those arguments must now be passed to
+:func:`~django.core.mail.get_connection` instead, and passing them along with
+a ``connection`` raises :exc:`TypeError`.
+
+The default for ``fail_silently`` in these APIs is now ``None``, rather than
+``False``.
+
